{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for trying the Shatterland demo!<br><br>Here are some important details so you know what to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partial Map</strong>: the full map is not yet available. You can still explore freely with no fake walls, but areas at the edge of the map are currently empty in this demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Weapons</strong>: not all weapons planned for the full release are included. In particular, <strong>mystical weapons</strong> are not available in this demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Quests Only</strong>: only a few introductory quests are playable. More advanced and story-driven quests will be available in the full version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vehicles</strong>: in this demo you can use the <strong>helicopter</strong> and the <strong>pickup truck</strong>. The <strong>boat</strong> and other vehicles will be available in the full release.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>.Made By a Solo Dev.</strong><br><br><strong>Last Pulse Studio</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">We Make Simple and Fun Games</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/01319d7cb31055ee56e0ba45c11051fa.avif?t=1757447742\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/33bc62ae8f7cd559456d2fa71ea874ae.avif?t=1757447742\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Uncover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.mp4?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were taken as a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripped from your home and locked away in a hidden laboratory. You were different your parents knew it. The government knew it. And they wanted to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested. Modified. Controlled. You were meant to be a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the experiment failed. Your powers were stolen, replicated, and twisted. Instead of strength, the military\u2019s project unleashed devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/876abaeb695f4de988926de7fb92a72b.avif?t=1757447742\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/e174d5f7a1f7eb87b257c6fe324b5051.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/e174d5f7a1f7eb87b257c6fe324b5051.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/3c72e491ee2d1340e5b8d4b0e750a574.avif?t=1757447742\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterland</strong> is a survival/exploration open-world zombie game featuring base-building, skill progression, and online co-op play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, fight, and explore a shattered world while reclaiming your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World</strong><br>A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.mp4?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Fight to Survive</strong><br>Battle hordes of the undead, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/b5344976948c4491e231e2122b40f932.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/b5344976948c4491e231e2122b40f932.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on story-driven adventures and discover the secrets of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.mp4?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, upgrade, and maintain vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.mp4?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> <br>Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.poster.avif?t=1757447742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.webm?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.mp4?t=1757447742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong> <br>Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong> <br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.<br><br><br>Last Pulse Studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/extras/2149d1e7d796d879d590c58df1765411.avif?t=1757447742\" width=1560 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020910?t=1757447742","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020910?t=1757447742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/9aace095bf96abf5f14a9baa7d0b316b186b9c2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757447742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020910/9aace095bf96abf5f14a9baa7d0b316b186b9c2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757447742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descripto